why legs 2 and 3 are in the plan.\n- **Why not swap on Ethereum and bridge USDC:** that route costs about $5.30, and arb1 would still need the gas ETH.\n- **Ethereum wallet:** eth1 keeps about 0.048 ETH, well above its gas reserve.\n- **Execution:** I will run the legs one at a time. I'll confirm each one and check the destination balance before starting the next.\n\nDo you approve this plan (approval ID `appr_12`)?"}]},{"role":"user","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_12"},"id":"toolu_01GMnM2XRi149XNTUD21N2K1"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_13\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01GMnM2XRi149XNTUD21N2K1","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_13"},"id":"toolu_01Jjj4XckpYvPkJN2S2axtEN"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Jjj4XckpYvPkJN2S2axtEN","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_0162rsKN6zxDQ6FowYN7BkRW"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_0162rsKN6zxDQ6FowYN7BkRW","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_7","approval_id":"appr_12"},"id":"toolu_01WYNt6PzcKea22byeQYYDse"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":34,"content":[{"type":"toolResul