e wallet also holds 0.000813 ETH of gas, which is what's left of the 0.000833 ETH I bridged after the swap.\n- **Ethereum leftover:** eth1 still holds 0.0465 ETH.\n- **Cost:** the quoted total was about $10.22, against your $15 cap. I didn't re-total the costs after execution.\n\nNo legs are still in transit."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"ef01d7df35833c62b0f7669c99ed61d5a5cf20b5eae548ef34df5cbc1d086ede","redactions":{}}}}
